<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:19:28 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，接替乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</link><description>&lt;p&gt;截至 2026 年 11 月 21 日，航空母舰所在位置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington"&gt;西奥多·罗斯福号航空母舰抵达中东，救援乔治·华盛顿号航空母舰&lt;/a&gt;后，首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:11:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/theodore-roosevelt-strike-group-arrives-in-the-middle-east-relieving-uss-george-washington</guid></item><item><title>地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我嘴里有股奇怪的黄铜味，你尝到了吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216"&gt;“地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情”&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:12:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-216</guid></item><item><title>空军一号从中国出发的长途飞行不仅仅是打破记录</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records</link><description>&lt;p&gt;VC-25B 桥式喷气式飞机提高了空军一号执行空运任务时在高空停留时间的标准，但波音公司的新型 VC-25B 喷气式飞机可能无法做到这一点。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records"&gt;空军一号从中国出发的长途飞行不仅仅是打破记录，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:39:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/there-is-more-to-air-force-ones-long-flight-from-china-than-just-breaking-records</guid></item><item><title>奇怪的CFL-120卡帕特中型坦克配备大炮面对装甲日益敌视的战场</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor</link><description>&lt;p&gt;该车辆配备 120 毫米火炮和 35 吨履带式底盘，随着无人机的出现，任何重量的装甲车都变得越来越复杂。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor"&gt;配备大炮的奇怪 CFL-120 卡帕特中型坦克面对装甲日益敌视的战场，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:26:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/oddball-cfl-120-karpat-medium-tank-with-a-big-120mm-gun-faces-a-battlefield-increasingly-hostile-to-armor</guid></item><item><title>海军 CCA 计划不会等待 F/A-XX 下一代战斗机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter</link><description>&lt;p&gt;海军的协同作战飞机愿景正在巩固，F-35 可以充当这些无人机的第一批空中“四分卫”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后 &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter"&gt;海军 CCA 计划不会等待 F/A-XX 下一代战斗机&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:38:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/navy-cca-plans-will-not-wait-for-f-a-xx-next-generation-fighter</guid></item><item><title>神秘的MQ-25类似黄貂鱼的中国无人机出现在鲜为人知的飞行测试中心</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在中国一处不起眼的飞行试验设施中拍摄到的不明无人机的卫星图像引发了有趣的问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center"&gt;神秘的 MQ-25 类似黄貂鱼的中国无人机在鲜为人知的飞行测试中心出现，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:16:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/mysterious-mq-25-stingray-like-chinese-drone-emerges-at-little-known-flight-test-center</guid></item><item><title>当总统出国旅行时，这架喷气式飞机总是尾随空军一号</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/why-the-e-4b-doomsday-plane-always-shadows-air-force-one-when-the-president-travels-abroad</link><description>&lt;p&gt;E-4B Nightwatch 是一架经过大幅改装的 747 飞机，是五角大楼的生存机载指挥所，附近拥有一个是美国总统出访海外的标准配置。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/why-the-e-4b-doomsday-plane-always-shadows-air-force-one-when-the-president-travels-abroad"&gt;总统出国旅行时，总是尾随空军一号的喷气式飞机&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:01:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/why-the-e-4b-doomsday-plane-always-shadows-air-force-one-when-the-president-travels-abroad</guid></item><item><title>Regent Squire 地翼效应无人机在中东海域巡逻</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/regent-squire-wing-in-ground-effect-drone-to-patrol-middle-east-waters</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着五角大楼继续向该地区派遣无人系统，乡绅被派往中央司令部的责任区。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/regent-squire-wing-in-ground-effect-drone-to-patrol-middle-east-waters"&gt;Regent Squire 翼地效应无人机在中东水域巡逻&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:08:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/regent-squire-wing-in-ground-effect-drone-to-patrol-middle-east-waters</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰想要更多幻影 2000 战斗机。他们从哪里来？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/ukraine-wants-more-mirage-2000-fighters-where-could-they-come-from</link><description>&lt;p&gt;快速获得更多幻影 2000 是基辅的首要任务，但找到大量的幻影 2000 并不容易。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/ukraine-wants-more-mirage-2000-fighters-where-could-they-come-from"&gt;乌克兰想要更多幻影 2000 战斗机。他们从哪里来？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:57:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/ukraine-wants-more-mirage-2000-fighters-where-could-they-come-from</guid></item><item><title>卫星图像显示最新海王星导弹袭击刻赤大桥的影响</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/impacts-of-latest-neptune-missile-strike-on-kerch-bridge-seen-in-satellite-imagery</link><description>&lt;p&gt;事实证明，对乌克兰来说，铁路跨度比公路跨度更难破解。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/impacts-of-latest-neptune-missile-strike-on-kerch-bridge-seen-in-satellite-imagery"&gt;卫星图像中最新海王星导弹袭击刻赤桥的影响帖子&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:14:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/impacts-of-latest-neptune-missile-strike-on-kerch-bridge-seen-in-satellite-imagery</guid></item></channel></rss>